  "preimage_rule": "receipt_hash = SHA256(JSON.stringify({agent,claim_sha256,ts,prev_hash,notary_fp,resolver_hash?,reasoning_trace_hash?,drand_round?,drand_randomness?})) — fixed key order, optional keys only when present, drand pair together.",
